{"sourceUrl":"https://cvm.njau.edu.cn/info/1137/9633.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:10.406433+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://cvm.njau.edu.cn/info/1137/9633.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>根据教育部相关文件要求，为规范我</span></span><span><span>院</span></span><span><span>招收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士学位研究生（以下简称推免生）工作，依照南京农业大学有关文件精神，结合我院实际情况，现将有关事项通知如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>    <span>一</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、接收推免生基本条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>第一条</span> <span>品德良好，遵纪守法，诚实守信，学风端正。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>第二条</span> <span>勤奋学习，刻苦钻研，学术兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识和创新能力。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>第三条</span> <span>取得本科就读学校推荐免试资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>第四条</span></span> <span><span>身体健康状况符合国家和我校规定的体检要求</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>第</span></span><span><span>五</span></span><span><span>条</span> <span>未有任何尚在期限内的处分。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>第六条</span> <span>申请人在本科阶段公开发表过学术论文或取得科研成果或在国内外重大竞赛中获奖，可优先考虑。</span> </span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、接收面试工作程序</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）报名：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>即日起至</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>20</span><span>日</span><span>15:00</span><span>（期间</span><span>24</span><span>小时开放），凡符合上述申请条件且有意愿报考我院的优秀应届本科毕业生，请登录“</span></span><a href=\"http://202.195.244.190/GTS/Tmsgl/default.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>南京农业大学接收推荐免试研究生网上申请系统</span></span></a><span><span>”，务必如实填写各项信息并提交。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）面试：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>面试时间：</span></span><span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>21</span><span>日上午</span><span>8:30</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>面试对象：南京农业大学接收推荐免试研究生网上申请系统内报名的推免生</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>面试地点：南京农业大学卫岗校区逸夫楼</span><span>3036</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、其他事项</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span><span>、保送采用导师和学生双向选择的办法。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span><span>、</span></span><span><span>所有接到复试通知的推免生须在规定时间内</span><span>“接受复试通知”并参加学院组织的复试，否则视为放弃复试资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span><span>、</span></span><span><span>面试合格的学生如在最后一学年表现不好或学习松懈，成绩不合要求者，学校取消其录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4</span><span>、拟录取人员需和学院签定诚信协议。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>、未尽事宜依照校研究生院发布的文件执行</span><span>https://zsgz.njau.edu.cn/info/1007/1651.htm</span><span>。</span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>动物医学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>20</span><span><span>25</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span>9</span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span>日</span></span> </p>\n<p></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"78b2b1d8eeff365fa8caa0623cc3e75e791f7de819a59a63149a893ba0408f7c","textLength":667,"sourceSha256":"82b77e591f0bf06c41250a14931522f71bdfceb6a2b2fda8ca89aa84b546d1c5","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-27da6b30ef62bd405a33","title":"2025年南京农业大学动物医学院2026年招收推荐免试研究生工作通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:10.406433+00:00"}
